A macro call naming a config path that declares no macro fails with the path on stderr, exit 2,
and leaves the file untouched.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: draft
---

# Foo

Body paragraph.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md "created={{ macro('core.macros.nope') }}"
-- exit --
2
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: value "{{ macro('core.macros.nope') }}": no macro declared at config path: core.macros.nope
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: draft
---

# Foo

Body paragraph.
